  "title": "NextNav Statement on Nomination of Danielle Thumann Severs",
  "summary": "“We congratulate Danielle Thumann Severs on her nomination to the FCC. As Senior Counsel to Chairman Carr, she brings a wealth of institutional, legal, and telecommunications expertise on a wide range of regulatory issues that will be invaluable to the Commission. We urge the Senate to move swiftly to confirm her.\"",
